          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imp 无法安全地保存密钥。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Imp couldn't read its links yet. It tries again when your iPhone is unlocked." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imp aún no puede leer sus vínculos. Lo intentará de nuevo cuando desbloquees el iPhone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imp 暂时无法读取它的连接。iPhone 解锁后会再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Imp for iPhone" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imp for iPhone"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imp para iPhone"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPhone 版 Imp"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Imp is at its limit of links or visiting Imps." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imp is at its limit of links or visiting Imps."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imp está en su límite de vínculos o de Imps visitantes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接数或来访 Imp 数已达上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Imp is still starting. Try again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imp is still starting. Try again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imp aún está arrancando. Inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imp 仍在启动。请再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Imps of this iPhone on other devices come home, and every Imp visiting here goes home. Codes shown before stop working; link again with a new one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los Imps de este iPhone que estén en otros dispositivos vuelven a casa, y todos los Imps que visitan este iPhone regresan a la suya. Los códigos mostrados antes dejan de funcionar; vuelve a vincular con uno nuevo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 iPhone 上位于其他设备的 Imp 会回家，来此做客的 Imp 也都会回到各自的家。之前显示过的代码将失效；请用新代码重新关联。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Imps of this iPhone that %@ holds come home. Its Imps visiting here go home to it. To link again, one of you shows a new code." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los Imps de este iPhone que tiene %@ vuelven a casa. Sus Imps que visitan este iPhone vuelven con él. Para vincular de nuevo, uno de los dos muestra un código nuevo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 持有的此 iPhone 的 Imp 会回家。它来此做客的 Imp 会回到它那里。要再次关联，请其中一方显示新代码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It thinks right here on your iPhone, with its tools, and can message your other Imps too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piensa aquí mismo, en tu iPhone, con sus herramientas, y también puede escribir a tus otros Imps."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它就在你的 iPhone 上思考，可以使用自己的工具，也能给你的其他 Imp 发消息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It works on %@, with its tools, and can message the Imps there too. Pictures, voices and files it makes show up right here." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It works on %@, with its tools, and can message the Imps there too. Pictures, voices and files it makes show up right here."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trabaja en %@, con sus herramientas, y también puede escribir a los Imps de allí. Las imágenes, voces y archivos que crea aparecen aquí mismo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它在 %@ 上使用那里的工具工作，也能给那里的 Imp 发消息。它生成的图片、语音和文件会直接显示在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its chats and keys are forgotten. This can't be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se olvidan sus chats y claves. No se puede deshacer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它的聊天和密钥都会被清除，此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its home isn't around" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Its home isn't around"
